{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"d65b281e-32d7-4b57-a814-dd4c966a6486","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have the full picture. Let me begin Step 1 — reading the problem and doing semantic segmentation, then searching.\n\n## Step 1: 语义分割\n\n**Q6.5**: 有哪些芯片设计模拟器、评估框架与工具链可以评估MoE、DiT、多模态、Video推理负载在Chiplet/Wafer-Scale/PIM/NoC等芯片级设计下的性能？各工具的方法学、建模粒度和适用范围是什么？\n\n逻辑链条拆分：\n\n| 节点 | 原文片段 | 逻辑角色 | 核心概念 |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|\n| S1 | Timeloop、MAESTRO、ScaleSim、BookSim、Simba、Gem5-GPU、FireSim等 | 对象/工具识别 | Timeloop, MAESTRO, ScaleSim, BookSim, Simba, Gem5-GPU, FireSim, simulator |\n| S2 | 评估MoE、DiT、多模态、Video推理负载 | 评估目标/模型负载 | MoE inference, DiT inference, multimodal, Video inference |\n| S3 | Chiplet/Wafer-Scale/PIM/NoC等芯片级设计 | 评估范围/芯片范式 | Chiplet, Wafer-Scale, PIM, NoC |\n| S4 | 各工具的方法学、建模粒度和适用范围 | 评估维度 | methodology, modeling granularity, cycle-level, analytical |\n\nNow let me execute Level A searches across all four directories:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":20884,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"70544232-8321-4574-8614-1154ac596af9","uuid":"eb20e171-86ae-42b9-b3d8-20ab4ac69f3c"}
